@startuml CU-04
actor "Administrador" as Adm
boundary "«UI» Angular (admin)" as UI
control "«Controller» API /users" as Ctrl
entity "«Model» UserService / user, role, employee" as Model

Adm -> UI : Abrir panel de administración
UI -> Ctrl : GET /users?page=&size= (Bearer)
Ctrl -> Model : list_users(db, page, size)
Model --> Ctrl : usuarios + roles
Ctrl --> UI : 200 UserRead[]

Adm -> UI : Crear usuario con roles
UI -> Ctrl : POST /users (email, password, roles)
Ctrl -> Model : create(db, payload)
Model --> Ctrl : UserRead (roles asignados)
Ctrl --> UI : 201 UserRead

Adm -> UI : Actualizar usuario (teléfono / activo / roles)
UI -> Ctrl : PATCH /users/{id}
Ctrl -> Model : update(db, user_id, payload)
Model --> Ctrl : UserRead actualizado
Ctrl --> UI : 200 UserRead

Adm -> UI : Habilitar / deshabilitar cuenta
UI -> Ctrl : PATCH /users/{id} (activo=false)
Ctrl -> Model : update(db, user_id, payload)
Ctrl --> UI : UserRead (inactivo)

Adm -> UI : Consultar roles disponibles
UI -> Ctrl : GET /users/roles
Ctrl -> Model : list_roles(db)
Model --> Ctrl : roles
Ctrl --> UI : RoleRead[]

Adm -> UI : Vincular empleado a sucursal
UI -> Ctrl : POST /users/{id}/employee (branch_id)
Ctrl -> Model : link_employee(db, user_id, payload)
Model --> Ctrl : EmployeeRead (branch)
Ctrl --> UI : 201 EmployeeRead

@enduml